              "text": "                        School of Computer Science, McGill University\r\n                               COMP-512: Distributed Systems\r\n\r\n\r\n                              User Guide to Client Interface\r\n\r\n                                                  .\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThis document gives an outline of how to use the client interface provided for the first programming\r\nassignment.\r\n\r\n\r\n   • Help\r\n     Provides information about the available commands\r\n     Help : list of all commands\r\n     Help,<command>: detailed description of command\r\n\r\n   • Add a new flight\r\n     Add information about a new flight\r\n     AddFlight,<FlightNumber>,<NumberOfSeats>,<PricePerSeat>\r\n\r\n   • Add a new car location\r\n     Add information about a new car location\r\n     AddCars,<Location>,<NumberOfCars>,<PricePerCar>\r\n\r\n   • Add a new room location\r\n     Add information about a new room location\r\n     AddRooms,<Location>,<NumberOfRooms>,<PricePerRoom>\r\n\r\n   • Add a new customer\r\n     Add a new customer to the database AddCustomer: system provides customer ID\r\n     AddCustomerID,<CustomerID>: user provides customer ID\r\n\r\n   • Delete a flight\r\n     Delete information about a flight (fails if reservations present)\r\n     DeleteFlight,<FlightNumber>\r\n\r\n   • Delete a car location\r\n     Delete all cars from a location (fails if reservations present)\r\n     DeleteCars,<Location>\r\n\r\n   • Delete a room location\r\n     Delete all rooms from a location (fails if reservations present)\r\n     DeleteRooms,<Location>\r\n\r\n                                                  1\r\n\f• Delete a customer\r\n  Delete a customer from the database as well as their reservations\r\n  DeleteCustomer,<CustomerID>\r\n• Query a flight\r\n  Obtain the number of available seats on a flight\r\n  QueryFlight,<FlightNumber>\r\n• Query a car location\r\n  Obtain the number of available cars at a location\r\n  QueryCars,<Location>\r\n• Query a room location\r\n  Obtain the number of available rooms at a location\r\n  QueryRooms,<Location>\r\n• Query a customer\r\n  Generate the bill (based on reservations) of a customer\r\n  QueryCustomer,<CustomerID>\r\n• Query a flight price\r\n  Obtain the price of a seat on a flight\r\n  QueryFlightPrice,<FlightNumber>\r\n• Query a car price\r\n  Obtain the price of a car at a location\r\n  QueryCarsPrice,<Location>\r\n• Query a room price\r\n  Obtain the price of a room at a location\r\n  QueryRoomsPrice,<Location>\r\n• Reserve a flight\r\n  Reserve a flight number for a customer\r\n  ReserveFlight,<CustomerID>,<FlightNumber>\r\n• Reserve a car\r\n  Reserve a car for a customer at a location\r\n  ReserveCar,<CustomerID>,<Location>\r\n• Reserve a room\r\n  Reserve a room for a customer at a location\r\n  ReserveRoom,<CustomerID>,<Location>\r\n• Reserve a bundle\r\n  Book 1+ flights, and an optional car/room at a location (0/1 value) for a customer\r\n  Bundle,<CustomerID>,<FlightNumber1>,...,<FlightNumberN>,\r\n  <Location>,<BookCar?>,<BookRoom?>\r\n• Quitting\r\n  Exit the application\r\n  Quit\r\n\r\n\r\n                                               2\r\n\f"
